{
 "what": "D-037 follow-up, owner 2026-10-21: 'Make sure the crest zooms are still visible, ship and test'. Light's crests over the spectrum on an engine zoom ladder: open sea at 12N 125W (about 2 m), z 1.6 / 2.2 / 3.0 / 3.8 / 4.6 / 6.0 / 7.4 / 9.0, plus the storm at regional zoom (z 4.6). Production build of claude/wave-light-spectrum with the lift and its levers; offline synthetic backend (never the live one).",
